	</entry>
	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  liste des membres d'un groupe]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=7629#p7629"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>SELECT grantor.rolname as grantor, member.rolname as member from pg_auth_members join pg_roles member on (pg_auth_members.member=member.oid) join pg_roles grantor on (pg_auth_members.grantor=grantor.oid);</p>]]></content>
